FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://api.example.com

# Accounts API

Composition via MSON inheritance: the AdminUser data structure extends User
(declared as `## AdminUser (User)`), so admin payloads reuse the base user
fields and add their own.

## Users Collection [/users]

### List users [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (array[User])

### Create a user [POST]

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (User)

+ Response 201 (application/json)
    + Attributes (User)

## Admins Collection [/admins]

### List admins [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (array[AdminUser])

### Promote to admin [POST]

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (AdminUser)

+ Response 201 (application/json)
    + Attributes (AdminUser)

# Data Structures

## User (object)
+ id: `u-1001` (string, required) - Unique user identifier.
+ email: `kai@example.com` (string, required) - Login email address.
+ displayName: `Kai` (string, optional) - Preferred display name.

## AdminUser (User)
+ scope: `billing` (string, required) - Administrative scope granted.
+ mfaEnrolled: true (boolean, required) - Whether MFA is enforced.
